────────────────────────────────────────
error[S30]: An aggregate can't be nested inside another aggregate.
  --> dict.yaml:13:19
   |
LL |   - name: orders
...
LL |       - name: double_counted
LL |         expr: SUM(total)
   |                   ^^^^^ this argument of `SUM` is already an aggregate
